                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65a1d689-0b8b-3573-93d7-3e11d7c38773",
                                        "entry_id": "d039c481-cd2e-39b1-997b-4fe88e696a12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The study of the past by excavation and analysis of its material remains."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "644c8cae-2cc0-48b3-a2ee-b4836f9474cf",
                                                "sense_id": "65a1d689-0b8b-3573-93d7-3e11d7c38773",
                                                "text": "^({1}) He first presented a complementary thesis on the Enlightenment philosopher Immanuel Kant (1724–1804), in which he used the term “archaeology” for the first time, and which indicated the period of history to which he was constantly to return.\n^({2}) The latent grid of knowledge which organizes every scientific discourse and defines what can or cannot be thought scientifically — the process of uncovering these levels Foucault calls 'archaeology'.\n^({3}) “Archaeology”, as the investigation of that which renders necessary a certain form of thought, implies an excavation of unconsciously organized sediments of thought. Unlike a history of ideas, it doesn’t assume that knowledge accumulates towards any historical conclusion. Archaeology ignores individuals and their histories. It prefers to excavate impersonal structures of knowledge.\nArchaeology is a task that doesn’t consist of treating discourse as signs referring to a real content like madness. It treats discourses, such as medicine, as practices that form the objects of which they speak."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2fb1156-a535-325d-a142-f8dad578714a",
                                        "entry_id": "d039c481-cd2e-39b1-997b-4fe88e696a12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The study of the past by excavation and analysis of its material remains.",
                                            "The actual excavation, examination, analysis, and interpretation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e547cb17-45e0-462b-943f-c67c0e7e5537",
                                                "sense_id": "d2fb1156-a535-325d-a142-f8dad578714a",
                                                "text": "The building's developers have asked for some archaeology to be undertaken."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "063122bf-e1fe-3277-9164-bb5b49045ccc",
                                        "entry_id": "d039c481-cd2e-39b1-997b-4fe88e696a12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The study of the past by excavation and analysis of its material remains.",
                                            "The actual remains together with their location in the stratigraphy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2629524d-ff17-4ed7-b0b4-7009a88bfe08",
                                                "sense_id": "063122bf-e1fe-3277-9164-bb5b49045ccc",
                                                "text": "The archaeology will tell us which methods of burial were used by the Ancient Greeks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f645d7c8-c1d9-3c69-b3ab-18df1f911173",
                                        "entry_id": "d039c481-cd2e-39b1-997b-4fe88e696a12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The study of the past by excavation and analysis of its material remains.",
                                            "The academic subject; in the USA: one of the four sub-disciplines of anthropology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0967677a-11f7-4b52-bece-e21c6a5bd611",
                                                "sense_id": "f645d7c8-c1d9-3c69-b3ab-18df1f911173",
                                                "text": "She studied archaeology at Edinburgh University."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "55e648cb-93b5-4e52-ab58-ca46a2e9d2c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "4705f900-6d19-32bb-851a-45b5b48fadc1",
                        "source_sense_id": "ded530b7-23e6-3171-b33d-79602f215a60",
                        "target_lang_word": "arqueología",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "arqueología",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d74066d8-f553-32d9-b0ee-2610d63680ec",
                                        "entry_id": "62b1500a-832f-3068-ba65-afd1711089fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Disciplina que estudia las civilizaciones de la Antigüedad y prehistoria a partir de los documentos y artefactos que de ellas subsisten."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83b0233f-77be-4e19-b4da-b047a2b91fba",
                                                "sense_id": "d74066d8-f553-32d9-b0ee-2610d63680ec",
                                                "text": "los habitantes, no menos instruidos en arqueología que los meridenses, le llaman también el ‘baño de los moros’."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65a80489-f7c5-42e2-b133-2176b7c7b7f9",
                                                "sense_id": "d74066d8-f553-32d9-b0ee-2610d63680ec",
                                                "text": "A diez metros de profundidad, y en parajes á catorce de amontonados escombros, se hallan los vestigios de su civilizacion púnico-romana que la arqueología[Siguiente] busca con avidez, bajo las otras dos capas de la árabe y la bizantina."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "291c4f45-75d7-4a72-b5a9-9545744d263c",
                                                "sense_id": "d74066d8-f553-32d9-b0ee-2610d63680ec",
                                                "text": "El error del sabio benedictino en cuanto a la atribución clásica, es propio de la arqueología de su tiempo, y aun puede tener por excusa el haberse encontrado algún epígrafe romano en tal o cual túmulo."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36f7b383-411d-3291-b3e2-8047dbdf7112",
                                        "entry_id": "62b1500a-832f-3068-ba65-afd1711089fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Por metonimia, conjunto de documentos y artefactos arqueológicos que se encuentran en una región o período."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b12379b-9233-44ee-ae36-7d08aae86ab1",
                                                "sense_id": "36f7b383-411d-3291-b3e2-8047dbdf7112",
                                                "text": "A Alejandro Pezzia, Director del Museo Regional de Ica, y su esposa por los datos y comentarios oportunos sobre la arqueología del lugar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9600d2c7-89e3-4277-8505-a239b0ec754a",
                                                "sense_id": "36f7b383-411d-3291-b3e2-8047dbdf7112",
                                                "text": "En el sector de Pumapungo, al sureste de la ciudad, entre la Calle Larga y la Avenida Huayna-Cápac, está el museo del Banco Central del Ecuador, que cuenta con notables colecciones de arqueología de diversos períodos, pero sobre todo, con piezas excepcionales encontradas in situ."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ae68872-8685-3714-9225-b75779053a05",
                                        "entry_id": "62b1500a-832f-3068-ba65-afd1711089fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Por extensión, cuestión o asunto de interés puramente histórico y sin relevancia práctica."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b78b5d07-1c61-4955-bb97-c67bc706708a",
                                                "sense_id": "4ae68872-8685-3714-9225-b75779053a05",
                                                "text": "Las casas, pues, son inútiles para los hombres; son un recuerdo tradicional de la familia, pura arqueología, y sólo se conservan como una necesidad de las calles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06e55ca2-b3b6-46c9-88da-7acce9820e6c",
                                                "sense_id": "4ae68872-8685-3714-9225-b75779053a05",
                                                "text": "Sí, todo eso del estúpido siglo xix de la burguesía capitalista, etc., es verdad y en general lo suscribo, pero nos ha legado algunas cosas inconmovibles y de primera, para mí: una de ellas la familia, la casa, todo eso que ahora parece ya arqueología indescifrable a los necios del ‘progreso’."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
